    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><strong>HO HO HO It`s Christmas Time!</strong></u> <br><strong>Christmas Chaos</strong> is a multiplayer party game perfect for the holiday spirit! Team up with friends and dive into 2 exciting modes (2 more are planned):  <br> <br><u><i>Mode 1 Gift Hunt:</i></u> <br>Get your friends together and battle to determine who will be the Santa of the year. <br><i>Features:</i></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fighting (PVP)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect Gifts</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Different power ups (cookie, hot chocolate)</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock fresh goggles<br> </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i><u>Mode 2 Cookie Chaos:</u></i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throw yourself into the chaos of a christmas bakery to spread the warmth of freshly baked cookies.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Bake against your friends</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect wood for your stove</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Mode 3 Santa`s Sleighrace:</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be announced</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i>Mode 4 Hide and Seek:</i></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To be announced</p>",
